#inherit/misc/bboard.c
dbase (["notes":({(["msg":"It's a good idea to put some help in login room, and other ideas there.But still can not see the need to put it in Xiake dao.  Why can not itbe placed in Yangzhou or Quanzhou or.....?","author":"拱猪王","time":833684351,"title":"login room",]),(["msg":"First of all, the key idea of the new login room is to lock player's acct on their email addresses, do part of the login job, and at the same timeshorten the login and make login daemon more stable. Putting help files isjust an auxiliary funtion.Secondly, the login room is only for first time players, they start from there,and they can go back to it only when they are very old ( more qualificationstandards needed here). It's a place of begining and ending, it should be anisolated place (an island will serve this purpose), and should be separatedfrom normal access. what's the point to put it in Quanzhou or Yangzhou or ... ?I won't discusss about it anymore, i am tired.","author":"火星人","time":833685873,"title":"re: 16",]),(["msg":"Ding coded the Huashan area long time ago, and mostlythere are a sword quest and one npc and several roomsI put a referee there so ppls can do 华山论剑 therebut right now is only halfly done cuz it's only 1 vs 1fight, can to form a 论剑, we need to do a lot more, likeselect the Top 10 -> Top 5, then let them fight to decide 东南西北中 排名 etc. then let them goto Tiahshan challenge the current 盟主 or 使者 and takeover.  So huashan can be reservered for 论剑, 独孤九剑quest, or maybe a 五岳剑派 there (?).  If I putthe 盟主 etc there, surely too conjested and alsobecause 泰山 is the highest in 五岳, and usually 皇帝封禅 there, not at 嵩山 (I think 金庸 made a mistake thereat 笑傲江湖), so that shud explain why I put him therightful place as a 武林至尊 shud reside, in the futuremaybe more details and restrictions shud be addedbased opun ppls's feedback and suggestion, also a 武林惯例and books may help to make it more reasonable.","time":833695393,"author":"清平剑","title":"about Huashan",]),(["msg":"I put a modified human.c in /d/working, pls take a lookat it, if the formula is acceptable, pls put it onlineby the way, the death penalty is already changed ?","author":"清平剑","time":833705267,"title":"jing & qi growth",]),(["msg":"I checked the code in /d/working, i don't feel like that \"int\" should beused as jing factor, because most players choose hi int anyways.  we mustbalance all attributes, there fore, i suggest to use \"con\" as the decidingfactor for both jing and qi... sword, let me knowwhat u think.yes, death penalty has been reduced to 2% exp, 1 level down.Xiang","time":833731693,"author":"翔少爷","title":"re: jing & qi",]),(["msg":"when you want to update a system file, please download the file first, thenmodify it, and upload.  if u use the file stored on ur machine, it might beoutdated, and create a big mess.Xiang","time":833733735,"author":"翔少爷","title":"about updating files",]),(["msg":"ok, I agree we can use \"con\" for all control factors for jing & qi growth, and marz, I suggest let monks be able to养精 instead of taoists, so we have taoists do 练气, monks do 养精。 cuz I think 禅宗 do a lot of 禅定, theyshud have higher jing to 内御心魔，外察红尘 so and somaybe we can give it a different name, but I thinkmarz's formula planned for taoist shud apply, justswitch to buddism + huanyuan-yiqi so.","author":"清平剑","time":833745899,"title":"re 20",]),(["msg":"use full \"con\" or \"int\" maybe good both way, cuz we can changethose books' jing cost to relate to the new changesi recommend use \"int\"/2 and change all book's jing cost aboveor around 30, so that will make it balanced.","author":"清平剑","time":833751400,"title":"about jing growth again",]),(["msg":"I got an idea: let qi growth related to (str + con)/2let jing growth related to (int + con)/2so jing is related to 根骨 and 悟性qi is with 根骨 and 膂力, it makes sense to mewe will have to change jing cost for study and learn accordinglyif we take this formula","author":"火星人","time":833753496,"title":"jing & qi growth",]),(["msg":"agree, good idea","author":"清平剑","time":833753741,"title":"re 24",]),(["msg":"Well, read more historical books before you blame Jin Yong made a mistakeby using Songshan as the fengchan site. Songshan was a more common place,although not the most famous one, for fengchan. Only very few empiros(Qin Shihuang, Han Wudi, Song Zhenzong) went to Taishan for fengchan.I am tired of arguing these kind of stupid questions here anymore. When Iproposed to create xkx in last Nov., I expected to see a mud truely basedon Jin Yong's novels. Too bad to see some of our wiz even don't know thisoriginal idea and don't know what this mud for. They even didn't read theoriginal design. Since they show little interest to change their unsuitableplan, I don't see any reason for me to continue to do the design job here.I will quit the designer job and won't care any design of xkx anymore. WhenI have more free time, I will propose and organize a new mud which will betruely based on Jin's fictions. We thought ES2 is stupid so we created xkx.If we think xkx is becoming stupid too, why not create a new one ?","author":"方大侠","time":833760308,"title":"fengchan",]),(["msg":"请各位巫师在本周末之前将自己的各项参数call好，我们将于这周六中午将所有巫师都降为immortal。经验必须小于十万，以后再逐步增多。这是因为我们几个天神调查了一些玩家，他们主要是因为巫师太多才没有兴趣来玩。:(","time":845941550,"author":"清妩","title":"Note!!!",]),(["msg":"  大家最好都用Ewan或Netterm编程，以免密码泄漏。 .","author":"含嫣","time":849088420,"title":"巫师请注意",]),(["msg":" ask 老才 about 柴刀 错误","time":849161777,"author":"含嫣","title":"a bug",]),(["msg":" 刚刚那个bug已经改好了，不过非常麻烦，hop最好能将  金庸群侠MUD移动一下位置","author":"含嫣","time":849162694,"title":"改好啦",]),(["msg":"赶快将金庸群侠传移到非root目录下。否则编程序太累","time":849248411,"author":"含嫣","title":"hop !!",]),(["msg":"不要为玩家修改天赋，hop注意哟还有，现在金庸群侠玩家太多，最好将玩家总数改为50人。","author":"含嫣","time":849252462,"title":"巫师注意",]),(["msg":"正在编程的巫师请注意,请先将程序仔细检查过后再放到服务器上调试,否则很容易引起宕机.谢谢!!","time":850263919,"author":"清妩","title":"编程巫师请注意",]),(["msg":"如题","author":"清妩","time":850746524,"title":"谁知道怎样判断一个NPC是昏迷的还是清醒的？",]),(["msg":"","time":851490803,"author":"水灵儿","title":"现在杀玩家有记录了",]),(["msg":"","author":"秘密","time":858860711,"title":"wiz hi",]),(["msg":"请定期更换密码。不要将密码告诉你的好朋友或别的什么人。。","time":865336305,"author":"清妩","title":"巫师们请注意",]),}),"id":"board","board_id":"wiz_b","capacity":30,"name":"巫师留言簿","location":"/d/wizard/wizard_room","no_get":1,"long":"这是一个专供巫师使用的留言板。",])
